OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks extra #13.5m to save
OL,4,AWinter Gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FMillions of pounds of funding are still
OL,7,Fneeded for a major restoration project
OL,8,Fof the UK's last surviving seafront
OL,9,FVictorian glasshouse due to rising
OL,10,Fcosts, a council has said.
OL,12,FThe Winter Gardens in Great Yarmouth,
OL,13,FNorfolk, which closed in 2008, is on
OL,14,FHistoric England's Heritage at Risk
OL,15,FRegister due to its deteriorating
OL,16,Fcondition.
OL,18,FGreat Yarmouth Borough Council has
OL,19,Falready secured #21.2m for the works,
OL,20,Fbut exploratory works have revealed a
OL,21,Ffurther #13.5m was still needed.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
